<!--
  ABYSS_DONOR_BEASTS_FREED_1. The storm giant of the Summ family (cast bible 2026-10-01 §4C/§5; owner named
  it: "Summ the All-Render, with the lesser forms of it other Summ creatures"). Replaces the donor-bodied
  ghorrumak (AA_Behemoth): own race, own art, no donor ParentName, texPath or MayRequire. Free RM_ tier.
  Alien megafauna in the krayt / zillo register, never a dragon: no wings, no fire.
  - RM_Summ (adult kind) and RM_Summing (the young: a kind on the same race that only generates young;
    baby/juvenile life stages draw the summing art). The race never stops growing: two late life stages
    (RM_SummElder, RM_SummAncient) keep raising body size, hunger and health.
  - Regenerates and burns in daylight (RM_CompSummHide.cs, two Abyss settings). Sees in the Dark: the murk
    touches humanlikes only.
  - The Witchfire storm call (ABYSS_DARK_BUILD_1, RM_MapComponentDark.TrySpawnSumm) looks up RM_Summ.
  The brood-mother RUT_SummAllRender and the egg are campaign content (ABYSS_LIGHTFALL_BROOD_WRECK_1).
-->
<Defs>

